##TEMPLATE-NAME 'Pascal - inline engine V1.3 - Rob F.M. van den Brink'
##LANGUAGE 'Object Pascal (like in Delphi, Virtual pascal, free pascal, etc)'
##ENGINE-NAME 'Pascal inline engine, by Rob F.M. van den Brink'
##AUTHOR 'Rob F.M. van den Brink - the Netherlands' 
##FILE-EXTENSION 'lpr'
##NOTES
(*) This template generates an inline parser engine, in (object) pascal code,
with full support of error productions (to recover from errors).
The lexer and parser are fully embedded in the rest of your code, so that 
other modules are not required.
(*) The resulting code can be compiled directly into a stand-alone program with 
a good object pascal compiler (like Virtual Pascal or Delphi). The
resulting progam will read an input file (specified on the command line)
and emits the tokens and associated actions to the screen.
(*) Since this engine has full support of error productions, and uses the SynError
token for that, you should define 'SynError' in the "virtual terminals" of your 
grammar.
(*) Since this engine support multiple as well as nested comments, the following
terminals have to be defined (if not used, define at as virtual terminal)
CommentStart CommentEnd CommentStart1 CommentEnd1 CommentStart2 CommentEnd2
On default, comments are NOT nested.

Version V1.1, Aug 2006
(c) Rob F.M. van den Brink - the Netherlands, 2006 - R.F.M.vandenBrink@hccnet.nl
- BugFix: Lexer did not handle comments correctly
- Added:  LexTable with lexemes, to improve readability of error messages
- Added:  Directive 'IsDELPHI' to compile under Delphi 7 too, (changefile extention to 'dpr')
- Added:  Several refinenemts

Usefull compilers are: 
	Virtual Pascal (www.vpascal.com - freeware, recommended),
	Delphi(www.borland.com - payware, recommended).
	Free Pascal (www.freepascal.org - freeware)  
	Kylix (not tested)
	GNU pascal (not tested)
For compiling with Delphi, define "IsDELPHI" directive, and change FILE-EXTERNTION 
from 'pas' to 'dpr', and a standalone console application will be generated

##END-NOTES
##ID-SEPARATOR '_'
##ID-CASE Uppercase
##DELIMITER ','
//---<This file is auto generated by GoldParser>-------------------------------
// Pascal_Engine.pgt, Version 1.1, Aug 2006
